  94+ 6D12                  ;
  95+ 6D12                  ; Porta $DF → riga P, O, I, U, Y.
  96+ 6D12                  ; Bit 0 = P (destra), Bit 1 = O (sinistra).
  97+ 6D12
  98+ 6D12 16 00            ld  d, $00                  ; azzera output
  99+ 6D14 01 FE DF         ld  bc, $dffe
